variable "versioning" {}
variable "kms_key" {}
variable "logging" {}
Imagine 40 variables.

✅

variable "bucket" {
  type = object({
    name        = string
    kms_key     = string
    versioning  = bool
    lifecycle   = number
  })
}
Everything related stays together.

